ments later the light suddenly  flashes and he realizes that a figure  somehow appears in the painting of the  house  cooper hears loud footsteps from  upstairs so he goes to the stairs when  josh peters his childhood bully out of  nowhere appears and startles him as he  anticipated the bully is just a  projection and doesn't move at all  katie explains to him that the system  could be mining some of his personal  memories and cooper was scared of him  while he was at high school  cooper then walks through him and gets a  glass of wine again  katie concludes that he is afraid  because he suddenly becomes talkative to  compensate for the fear  in the kitchen a wild huge spider with  peter's face suddenly appears  unfortunately katie who is observing  from the surveillance camera can't see  anything as the event is just happening  in cooper's mind  to make things worse the earpiece  suddenly ceases to work  soon after cooper hears someone banging  on the house's door  he bravely opens the door and sonia  randomly shows up  she states that cooper might be in  danger and urges him to leave  immediately  however cooper thinks that his encounter  with sonia is just part of the  experiment  sonia tries to convince him that the  experiment is dangerous  she reveals to him that five people and  all of them were tourists have  disappeared in the past year because  they applied themselves to the play test  job  cooper refuses to leave and still does  not believe every single word coming  from her mouth  sonja becomes upset and grabs a knife  threatening to hurt cooper  she manages to stab him and they fight  for a moment  getting cornered cooper then impales her  on a knife lodge through his shoulder  and the knife and sonia suddenly  disappear  the earpiece starts working again and  cooper goes crazy because sonia and the  fight feel so real for him  katie makes it clear that physical  sensation shouldn't be possible but  cooper refuses to continue the  experiment anymore  ka